    "description": "Combat 100% Whey drops the egg and milk protein for whey concentrate and whey isolate only. A 34 g scoop of Chocolate Milk gives 24 g of protein, 140 calories, 2 g of sugar and 3.5 g of fat, per the label at the time of writing. It is thickened with xanthan, cellulose and guar gums and sweetened with sucralose and acesulfame potassium. It sells in a 5 lb tub of about 67 to 70 servings, and the Informed Sport database lists it, with batches tested after January 14, 2025 moving from Informed Choice to Informed Sport.",
    "pros": [
      "Whey only, with no egg or milk protein concentrate",
