      "Informed Choice logo on retailer listings"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "About $2.16 per 25 g in the 5 lb tub at the price we saw",
      "Sucralose plus stevia, which some buyers find sweet"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The upgrade for lactose-sensitive lifters. Everyone else gets better value from Combat.",
